  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "80DA18B6BFF93169",
      "text": "Je vous en prie, entrez ! Hop hop hop ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "80DA15B6BFF92C50",
      "text": "Vous pouvez garder vos souliers. Quand ils sont\\ntrop sales, lavez-les au robinet près de l’entrée.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "80DA16B6BFF92E03",
      "text": "L’intérieur est joli, n’est-ce pas ?\\c\\nLe bâtiment n’a rien à envier aux grandes villes :\\nil est neuf et équipé des dernières technologies.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "80DA1BB6BFF93682",
      "text": "Ici, c’est le coin détente où vous pouvez regarder\\nla télé ou papoter à la bonne franquette.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "80DA1CB6BFF93835",
      "text": "La cafétéria est là-bas... Et les toilettes sont ici.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "80DA19B6BFF9331C",
      "text": "Si vous voulez faire un somme, utilisez\\nles chambres du fond.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "80DA1AB6BFF934CF",
      "text": "Il y en a assez pour tout le monde, vous n’aurez\\ndonc pas besoin de les partager.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "80DA1FB6BFF93D4E",
      "text": "Bien... Je pense avoir fait le tour.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "80DA20B6BFF93F01",
      "text": "Si vous avez besoin de quoi que ce soit,\\ndemandez à la dame de l’accueil.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "FFFDC851C0E18FAF",
      "text": "Merci infiniment pour cette petite visite guidée.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "FFFDC951C0E19162",
      "text": "Allons, les enfants ! Un petit mot gentil pour ces\\npersonnes qui nous reçoivent chaleureusement ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_01",
      "hash64": "CC80CF2E01435893",
      "text": "Merci pour votre accueil !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_02",
      "hash64": "CC80D02E01435A46",
      "text": "C’est un bonheur d’être ici !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7D65FF5EF2D2204",
      "text": "Merci pour votre accueil !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_02",
      "hash64": "C7D662F5EF2D271D",
      "text": "C’est un bonheur d’être ici !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "80DD1DB6BFFB6FBF",
      "text": "Tant de politesse, cela fait chaud au cœur ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "80DD1CB6BFFB6E0C",
      "text": "Profitez du séjour et faites comme chez vous ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "FFFDCA51C0E19315",
      "text": "Je suppose que ce long voyage vous a fatigués.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "FFFDC351C0E18730",
      "text": "Il est encore un peu tôt, mais je vous propose\\nde dîner dès maintenant ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "80DD1FB6BFFB7325",
      "text": "Nous vous avons préparé un festin ! Il y en aura\\npour tout le monde ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_01",
      "hash64": "0CD6A086E2AE6EE3",
      "text": "Géniaaal !!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_02",
      "hash64": "0CD6A186E2AE7096",
      "text": "Merci ! C’était très bon !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "FFFDC451C0E188E3",
      "text": "Ce soir, c’est quartier libre, mais attention !\\c\\nLes activités du voyage scolaire commenceront\\ndès demain matin ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "FFFDC551C0E18A96",
      "text": "Essaie donc de ne pas te coucher trop tard ![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_13",
      "hash64": "80DD1EB6BFFB7172",
      "text": "Les bons plats de Septentria étaient-ils à\\nton goût ?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "FFFDC651C0E18C49",
      "text": "Je dirai aux élèves de l’Institut Myrtille\\nde se joindre à nous demain matin.\\c\\nJ’espère que vous vous entendrez bien.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
